-- src:3314 | “trustee‑manager” —
-- src:3316 | (a) in relation to a registered business trust, has the
-- src:3317 | meaning given by section 2 of the Business Trusts
-- src:3318 | Act 2004;
-- src:3320 | (b) in relation to a business trust for which an application
-- src:3321 | for registration has been made under section 4(1) of
-- src:3322 | the Business Trusts Act 2004, means the company
-- src:3323 | proposed to be named as the trustee‑manager in the
-- src:3324 | application made under that section;
