-- src:3327 | entity which manages and operates the recognised
-- src:3328 | business trust, by whatever name called and whether
-- src:3329 | incorporated or not; and
-- src:3331 | (d) in relation to a business trust for which an application
-- src:3332 | for recognition has been made under
-- src:3333 | section 239D(1), means the entity proposed to be
-- src:3334 | managing and operating the trust, by whatever name
-- src:3335 | called and whether incorporated or not;
