GIVEN
    `the person is the trustee-manager of a registered business trust within section 2 of the Business Trusts Act 2004` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person the trustee-manager of a registered business trust as section 2 of the Business Trusts Act 2004 defines "trustee-manager"?
    `the company is the one proposed to be named as the trustee-manager in an application for registration under section 4(1) of the Business Trusts Act 2004` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the company the one proposed to be named as the trustee-manager in an application to register the business trust under section 4(1) of the Business Trusts Act 2004?
    `the entity manages and operates the recognised business trust, by whatever name called and whether incorporated or not` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the entity manage and operate the recognised business trust (by whatever name called, incorporated or not)?
    `the entity is proposed to be managing and operating the business trust in an application for recognition under section 239D(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the entity proposed to be managing and operating the business trust in an application for its recognition under section 239D(1)?
